{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:00.76] Enviyon on the mix\n[00:07.78] No, no, no, no\n[00:09.10] No-no, no, no, no\n[00:14.42] No, no, no, no, no\n[00:18.70] No, no, no, no\n[Chorus: Juice WRLD]\n[00:23.52] I still see your shadows in my room\n[00:26.20] Can't take back the love that I gave you\n[00:28.90] It's to the point where I love and I hate you\n[00:31.42] And I cannot change you, so I must replace you, oh\n[00:35.22] Easier said than done, I thought you were the one\n[00:38.00] Listenin' to my heart instead of my head\n[00:40.90] You found another one, but I am the better one\n[00:43.66] I won't let you forget me\n[00:46.38] I still see your shadows in my room\n[00:49.06] Can't take back the love that I gave you\n[00:51.74] It's to the point where I love and I hate you\n[00:54.28] And I cannot change you, so I must replace you, oh\n[00:57.56] Easier said than done, I thought you were the one\n[01:00.86] Listenin' to my heart instead of my head\n[01:03.74] You found another one, but I am the better one\n[01:06.46] I won't let you forget me\n[Verse 1: Juice WRLD]\n[01:08.72] You left me fallin' and landin' inside my grave\n[01:14.74] I know that you want me dead (Uh)\n[01:20.46] I take prescriptions to make me feel a-okay\n[01:26.18] I know it's all in my head\n[01:31.92] I have these lucid dreams where I can't move a thing\n[01:37.28] Thinking of you in my bed\n[01:42.98] You were my everything\n[01:45.82] Thoughts of a wedding ring\n[01:48.70] Now I'm just better off dead (Uh, uh, uh)\n[01:54.62] I'll do it over again\n[01:56.04] I didn't want it to end\n[01:57.48] I watch it blow in the wind\n[01:58.76] I should've listened to my friends\n[02:00.58] Leave this shit in the past, but I want it to last\n[02:03.34] You were made outta plastic, fake\n[02:05.94] I was tangled up in your drastic ways\n[02:08.70] Who knew evil girls had the prettiest face?\n[02:11.58] You gave me a heart that was full of mistakes\n[02:14.52] I gave you my heart and you made heartbreak\n[Bridge: Juice WRLD]\n[02:17.68] You made my heart break\n[02:20.14] You made my heart ache (I still see your shadows in my room)\n[02:29.94] You made my heart break\n[02:31.02] You made my heart ache (Can't take back the love that I gave you)\n[02:32.93] You made my heart break (Were made outta plastic, fake)\n[02:34.44] You made my heart ache (I still see your shadows in my room)\n[02:36.56] You made my heart break again (I was tangled up in your drastic ways)\n[02:38.25] (Who knew evil girls had the prettiest face?)\n[Verse 2: Lil Uzi Vert]\n[02:40.00] Cryin', I'm nauseous, I hear that so often\n[02:45.15] I sometimes get lost in my head\n[02:49.32] I'm so in love with that girl (Yeah)\n[02:52.40] I got the juice in this world (Woah)\n[02:54.46] She don't believe in loyalty, but want diamonds and pearls\n[02:57.82] Fuck that, I had to man up\n[03:00.14] Tried to boost my confidence and froze my hand up\n[03:03.26] I'm still hot, turn that fan on\n[03:05.72] This shit had me depressed, I almost died off Xan' punch (Yeah)\n[03:08.80] She said that she love me, but she sucked that boy up (Oh)\n[03:11.64] You got somethin' to say, go 'head now, boy, just speak up (Woah)\n[03:14.60] Tryna break me down because they can't defeat us (No)\n[03:17.52] I'm a baker now, like that girl Anita\n[03:20.18] Should've listened to my boy, he said, \"Don't keep her\"\n[03:23.08] Nowadays, I love you so much, I can't leave ya\n[Chorus: Juice WRLD & Lil Uzi Vert, Juice WRLD]\n[03:26.46] I still see your shadows in my room\n[03:29.04] Can't take back the love that I gave you\n[03:31.76] It's to the point where I love and I hate you\n[03:34.28] And I cannot change you, so I must replace you, oh\n[Outro: Juice WRLD]\n[03:38.90] Easier said than done, I thought you were—\n[03:42.12] —Instead of my head\n[03:43.70] You found another— better one\n[03:46.16] I won't let you forget me","words":[[0.1,0.2,"[Intro:"],[0.32,0.52,"Juice"],[0.58,0.7,"WRLD]"],[0.76,4.98,"Enviyon"],[5.22,5.4,"on"],[7.2